  "description": {
   "en": "Shen Jin Feng was eating when he was suddenly pulled into another dimension. In this world, survival depends on defeating monsters and leveling up, with everyone having a basic status panel for guidance. However, Shen Jin Feng quickly discovered that his panel was different. At first, he could only summon mirror images of enemies, but soon he realized he could even preclaim battle rewards — obtaining enemy mirror images, equipment, and experience before winning the fight.\n\nAlthough the number of mirror images he could summon was limited, each one represented the pinnacle of its class. Moreover, Shen Jin Feng could directly log into these mirror images and personally control them in battle.\n\nIn this world, some humans who arrived earlier had formed powerful hegemonies. They monopolized territories, bullied new arrivals, and hoarded resources — even requiring their permission just to fight monsters. To overthrow these tyrants, Shen Jin Feng, alongside his summoned mirror images, engaged in fierce battles against them."
  },
